        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>茶颜悦色品牌营销策略分析</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px 30px;\n    color: #222;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .title-box {\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 6px 0;\n    width: 60%;\n    margin: 0 auto 25px auto;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  h2.section {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  .price-strategy {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .item-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 10px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .item-body {\n    margin: 0 0 8px 20px;\n  }\n  .sub-point {\n    margin: 4px 0 4px 20px;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 300px;\n    left: 220px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #ccc;\n    transform: rotate(-15deg);\n  }\n  .cups-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n  }\n  .cup-block {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .cup-label {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #333;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 110px;\n    height: 160px;\n    border: 1px dashed #bbb;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #888;\n    background: #fafafa;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"title-box\">茶颜悦色品牌营销策略分析</div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"section\">三、茶颜悦色价格策略</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"price-strategy\">价格策略：薄利多销，打造性价比最高的茶饮品牌</div>\n\n  <div class=\"item-title\">1.主打10～20元价格带</div>\n  <div class=\"item-body\">位于奶茶的主力消费人群最多的价格区间，更具上升空间与竞争力</div>\n\n  <div class=\"item-title\">2.与竞品形成区隔，形成竞争壁垒</div>\n  <div class=\"sub-point\">·与喜茶、奈雪的茶相比，更具价格优势，拥有较高的品质和颜值，能向上触及高端茶饮消费群</div>\n  <div class=\"sub-point\">·与CoCo都可、书亦烧仙草等同价位品牌相比，产品颜值与文化属性更胜一筹</div>\n\n  <div class=\"item-title\">3.坚持不涨价原则</div>\n  <div class=\"item-body\">结合长沙地区物价水平，在高流量地区提供优质产品与服务</div>\n\n  <div class=\"item-title\">4.促销方式</div>\n  <div class=\"sub-point\">·开展\"小主节\"活动，开通会员卡享受充100送50，充200送100</div>\n  <div class=\"sub-point\">·雨天第二杯半价、周三特定产品半价、单品免费续杯、集卡点免费赠杯</div>\n\n  <div class=\"watermark\">[illegible watermark text]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"cups-row\">\n    <div class=\"cup-block\">\n      <div class=\"cup-label\">幽兰拿铁</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: milk tea cup with character art, left]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cup-block\">\n      <div class=\"cup-label\">[illegible]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: milk tea cup with character art, center]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cup-block\">\n      <div class=\"cup-label\">[illegible]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: milk tea cup with character art, right]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
